  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nYou're Barack Obama. 4 years into your retirement, you awake to find a letter with no return address on your bedside table. It reads \"I hope you've had a chance to relax Barack...but pack your bags and call the number below. It's time to start the real job.\" Signed simply, \"JFK.\" You call the number and the voice on the other end says \"Welcome back Mr. President.\n\n\"Back to where?,\" asks Obama.\n\nBack to Presidency, of course,\" replies JFK.\n\n\"But I'm retired,\" says Obama.\n\n\"Not anymore you're not,\" says JFK. \"I'm dead, but you don't hear me complaining.\"\n\n\"But I'm just a civilian now,\" says Obama.\n\n\"Not in this world,\" replies JFK. \"You're a President again, and you've got a country to run.\"\n\nAnd which country will that be?\"",
